{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05113","headline":"酬杨给事兼见赠台中 · 沈佺期","name":"酬杨给事兼见赠台中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子云推辨博，公理擅词雄。\n始自尚书省，旋闻给事中。\n言从温室秘，籍向琐闱通。\n顾我叨郎署，慙无草奏功。\n分曹八舍断，解袂五时空。\n宿昔陪余论，平生赖击蒙。\n神仙应东掖，云雾限南宫。\n忽枉琼瑶赠，长歌兰渚风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}